Audacious (aw-DAY-shus)
Meaning: bold and fearless
Hindi: साहसी / दुस्साहसी
Example: She made an audacious decision to start her own company.*
Benevolent (buh-NEV-uh-luhnt)
Meaning: kind and generous
Hindi: दयालु / उदार
Example: The benevolent king helped the poor.*
Cryptic (KRIP-tik)
Meaning: mysterious or difficult to understand
Hindi: गूढ़ / रहस्यमय
Example: He gave a cryptic reply.*
Dauntless (DAWNT-lis)
Meaning: fearless and determined
Hindi: निडर / साहसी
Example: The dauntless soldier fought bravely.*
Exuberant (ig-ZOO-buh-runt)
Meaning: full of energy and excitement
Hindi: उत्साहपूर्ण / जोशीला
Example: The children were exuberant during the festival.*
